WEBVTT

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.792
"One day, a monkey climbed a tree."

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.333
- "He said, 'I am the king of the jungle!""
- King!

00:00:13.417 --> 00:00:16.125
"The elephant said, 'Keep it down.'"

00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:19.417
- "'If you fall, you'll be crushed!'"
- Crushed!

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:26.917
Uncle!

00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:29.250
Oh my God!

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:34.292
- How have you been?
- Very well.

00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:36.708
So good to see you.

00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:38.583
Missed you so much!

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:44.667
Chander Uncle in peak form.

00:00:45.708 --> 00:00:48.708
- They love him.
- He's a special one.

00:00:48.792 --> 00:00:50.000
Most special.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:55.083
He just keeps talking about you.

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:56.833
He won't admit it,

00:00:56.917 --> 00:00:59.250
but his chess partner
is his most favorite.

00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:02.333
Damn chess! Damn chess!

00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:04.417
Can I tell you a secret?

00:01:05.417 --> 00:01:08.333
This cafe's energy comes
from my favorite person.

00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:11.708
Hello, hello!

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.500
- Hey!
- My favorite bread maker's back!

00:01:16.583 --> 00:01:17.458
Yes.

00:01:18.458 --> 00:01:20.292
So good to see you!

00:01:20.375 --> 00:01:22.458
I really missed your coffee!

00:01:22.542 --> 00:01:25.708
- Right away, right away!
- No, no. In a bit, in a bit.

00:01:25.792 --> 00:01:27.833
Sit, please. Take a chair.

00:01:33.708 --> 00:01:36.000
- So good to see you.
- So good to see you too.

00:01:36.083 --> 00:01:38.542
Your counter really misses you,
by the way, Mark Uncle.

00:01:38.625 --> 00:01:42.000
When you're here,
the cafe has a totally different vibe.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.542
So, are you ready? To come back?

00:01:48.375 --> 00:01:49.417
No.

00:01:50.042 --> 00:01:52.792
Please don't tell me
you're going back to California!

00:01:52.875 --> 00:01:55.333
- No!
- I mean… Listen.

00:01:55.917 --> 00:01:58.542
You know, I think it's time.

00:02:02.375 --> 00:02:04.375
These are the final years of my life

00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:07.500
and I want to spend them
close to my family.

00:02:07.583 --> 00:02:08.708
I mean…

00:02:10.083 --> 00:02:12.083
Besides, after Nilima passed away,

00:02:12.958 --> 00:02:14.708
my heart just isn't in it anymore, man.

00:02:18.167 --> 00:02:19.333
Hear me out.

00:02:19.417 --> 00:02:24.542
I want you to use my house
for the cafe's expansion.

00:02:24.625 --> 00:02:25.833
- What?
- Yes.

00:02:25.917 --> 00:02:27.083
No!

00:02:27.583 --> 00:02:29.083
I knew you wouldn't agree,

00:02:29.167 --> 00:02:32.000
but I was the first person
to invest in this cafe.

00:02:32.875 --> 00:02:34.500
So, I get this vote.

00:02:35.125 --> 00:02:36.083
Uncle.

00:02:37.083 --> 00:02:38.833
- This…
- We really don't know what to say.

00:02:38.917 --> 00:02:40.625
Just say thank you.

00:02:41.917 --> 00:02:43.125
For a change.

00:02:46.125 --> 00:02:48.625
- I'm just gonna be right back.
- Okay.

00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:52.583
- Yeah.
- Excuse me.

00:02:52.667 --> 00:02:53.750
Hi.

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:00.333
I have one request, Chander.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.792
- Can you promise me something?
- Of course.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:10.417
You will find Sudha.

00:03:13.583 --> 00:03:15.208
You will apologize to her.

00:03:16.167 --> 00:03:18.708
And you will get your closure, Chander.

00:03:20.125 --> 00:03:24.125
Otherwise, you'll never truly be able
to love Preeti the way she deserves.

00:04:34.292 --> 00:04:36.708
<i>Do you really have to leave so soon?</i>

00:04:36.792 --> 00:04:39.208
<i>Boss lady, I just came to surprise you.</i>

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.917
{\an8}Besides, it's only a matter of a month.

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:44.958
{\an8}After that, you'll come with me to Bombay

00:04:45.458 --> 00:04:46.708
{\an8}to help me settle down.

00:04:48.167 --> 00:04:49.583
{\an8}Are you sure you have to go?

00:04:50.958 --> 00:04:52.833
{\an8}What kind of question is that, Mom?

00:04:52.917 --> 00:04:55.333
{\an8}When I didn't accept the offer,
you gave me a long lecture.

00:04:56.292 --> 00:05:00.000
{\an8}And now that I've accepted it,
you have doubts?

00:05:01.667 --> 00:05:05.333
I've been observing you these last
two days. You seem a bit stressed.

00:05:06.417 --> 00:05:09.833
Yeah, just dealing with some
case-related problems.

00:05:11.917 --> 00:05:13.208
Okay, tell me.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.417
What's the name of this problem?

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.667
You found out?

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.750
- I bet Gargi told you, didn't she?
- Gargi?

00:05:22.958 --> 00:05:24.583
Does she ever tell me anything nowadays?

00:05:24.667 --> 00:05:26.917
She's less of a spy
and more of your friend.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.083
She just avoids the topic.

00:05:30.333 --> 00:05:33.625
Since yesterday, I've noticed
you've been constantly on your phone.

00:05:33.708 --> 00:05:36.750
One moment you're smiling,
the next you look sad.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.417
Tell me, what's his name?

00:05:42.708 --> 00:05:44.958
You won't ask any weird questions?

00:05:46.667 --> 00:05:48.958
Mom, promise me.

00:05:54.125 --> 00:05:57.583
- Chander.
- Chander Sharma?

00:05:57.667 --> 00:06:00.375
Yes. You are the cause of the problem.

00:06:00.958 --> 00:06:03.458
Okay, that's it.
Don't ask any more questions.

00:06:07.458 --> 00:06:09.875
Does he know about your job in Bombay?

00:06:10.417 --> 00:06:12.208
When you leave, will he go with you?

00:06:13.208 --> 00:06:15.000
We haven't talked about that yet.

00:06:15.083 --> 00:06:18.000
But I will soon.

00:06:18.792 --> 00:06:20.167
By the way, you know,

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:23.250
his mom is setting him up
with girls these days.

00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:27.625
Aren't you bothered by the fact
that he's meeting other girls?

00:06:27.708 --> 00:06:31.208
It was me who told him to meet them,
only to make his mom happy.

00:06:32.208 --> 00:06:33.542
Now I get it.

00:06:34.083 --> 00:06:36.125
Now that he went to meet them,

00:06:36.208 --> 00:06:38.542
my little girl's heart

00:06:39.583 --> 00:06:40.583
sank.

00:06:41.458 --> 00:06:43.750
Your little girl doesn't want
to get married right now.

00:06:43.833 --> 00:06:47.625
The boy is nice. His mom is nice too.

00:06:47.708 --> 00:06:51.167
- But--
- But I need to focus on my career.

00:06:52.458 --> 00:06:56.750
I have to carry forward and fulfil
the dreams we saw together.

00:06:57.583 --> 00:07:01.750
Sudha, finding a good partner in life
is very difficult.

00:07:02.375 --> 00:07:05.625
And finding love is even harder.

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:08.625
- And you're doing all this for me--
- Do you remember

00:07:08.708 --> 00:07:11.250
what I told you when I got my law degree?

00:07:12.375 --> 00:07:16.417
That I would always do things in life
that bring me closer to my goals.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:21.292
And, Mom, marriage just isn't
part of my plans right now.

00:07:22.958 --> 00:07:25.375
Does Chander have a problem
with your plan?

00:07:25.458 --> 00:07:27.167
- No.
- Then what?

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:30.750
Chander's life plans are different, Mom.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.417
Chander is a very good guy.

00:07:39.292 --> 00:07:41.375
He's incredibly caring and giving.

00:07:42.083 --> 00:07:44.583
And I like him a lot.

00:07:45.458 --> 00:07:48.875
But, Mom, how can I forget
about 15-year-old Sudha

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.625
whose dreams are all in Bombay?

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.167
So, long story short,

00:07:56.750 --> 00:08:00.917
if I don't take care of my sweet,
brave, beautiful boss lady,

00:08:01.417 --> 00:08:02.458
then who will?

00:08:03.792 --> 00:08:05.667
How long will you take care of me?

00:08:08.375 --> 00:08:11.250
Forever and ever, until my dying breath.

00:08:11.333 --> 00:08:12.500
Until I die.

00:08:12.583 --> 00:08:15.458
- Mom, what nonsense--
- Okay, sorry.

00:08:15.542 --> 00:08:16.625
Don't get mad.

00:08:17.667 --> 00:08:20.292
Just one question.
How old are you?

00:08:21.417 --> 00:08:23.500
- Mom.
- It's a simple question. Tell me.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:25.625
- Twenty-four.
- Twenty-four.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:30.125
Suppose I somehow stick around
for another 20 years,

00:08:30.208 --> 00:08:31.667
how old will you be then?

00:08:32.167 --> 00:08:33.542
Forty-four.

00:08:33.625 --> 00:08:35.458
Will you start your life then?

00:08:37.125 --> 00:08:38.542
Sudha, you always say

00:08:39.333 --> 00:08:42.500
that you shouldn't delay your happiness
for anyone else.

00:08:43.208 --> 00:08:45.083
So, you don't do it for me either.

00:08:46.833 --> 00:08:49.875
Don't repeat the mistake
your father and I made.

00:08:53.583 --> 00:08:54.583
<i>Sweetheart…</i>

00:08:55.292 --> 00:09:01.000
<i>Someone's presence can affect us</i>
<i>just as much as their absence.</i>

00:09:20.542 --> 00:09:22.875
- You!
- I've been calling you for so long.

00:09:22.958 --> 00:09:24.250
Why didn't you answer?

00:09:25.625 --> 00:09:26.583
Really?

00:09:28.542 --> 00:09:30.083
Oh, no. I'm so sorry.

00:09:33.458 --> 00:09:34.333
Hi.

00:09:36.375 --> 00:09:39.125
You know what? Life is very short.

00:09:43.875 --> 00:09:45.250
Vodka in the office?

00:09:46.083 --> 00:09:47.833
What have you done with Chander Sharma?

00:09:47.917 --> 00:09:51.917
Life is very short.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.125
Saying it over and over
won't make it longer.

00:09:58.667 --> 00:10:00.000
Life is…

00:10:01.917 --> 00:10:03.708
very short, Sudha.

00:10:04.333 --> 00:10:06.708
If you say that one more time,

00:10:06.792 --> 00:10:09.125
I'll murder you and make it even shorter.

00:10:12.958 --> 00:10:15.250
I'm going to do everything I want to do.

00:10:15.333 --> 00:10:16.875
What do you want to do?

00:10:18.167 --> 00:10:19.042
I don't know.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:26.500
If you don't know, what does it matter
if life is long or short?

00:10:27.667 --> 00:10:29.750
It matters. It matters a lot.

00:10:36.167 --> 00:10:38.250
Did something happen at the office today?

00:10:54.083 --> 00:10:55.042
Wow!

00:10:55.542 --> 00:10:57.542
Associate Vice President!

00:10:57.625 --> 00:10:59.208
Congratulations!

00:11:02.917 --> 00:11:05.542
Mom told me the same thing
before she left.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:09.000
"Life is very short, Chander. Be happy."

00:11:09.792 --> 00:11:12.875
My boss gave me this letter
and gifted me a bottle of vodka.

00:11:13.833 --> 00:11:16.833
He said, "Young man! Life is very short."

00:11:17.542 --> 00:11:19.375
"You've earned this promotion. Enjoy it."

00:11:24.333 --> 00:11:25.917
When Dad finds out,

00:11:27.333 --> 00:11:29.000
he'll be the happiest.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:30.708
He knows

00:11:30.792 --> 00:11:34.833
how many years I've worked hard
just to see this day.

00:11:36.875 --> 00:11:39.042
And now that this day is finally here,

00:11:40.375 --> 00:11:42.125
I don't feel anything at all.

00:11:45.125 --> 00:11:46.875
How would you feel anything?

00:11:48.292 --> 00:11:50.792
You're doing exactly
what you shouldn't be doing.

00:11:51.333 --> 00:11:54.250
You're also doing exactly
what you shouldn't be doing.

00:11:54.333 --> 00:11:58.167
- How?
- You're kind of stuck here in Bhopal.

00:12:00.292 --> 00:12:01.458
Because of me.

00:12:08.583 --> 00:12:11.042
Should we go somewhere else, Mr. Lovesick?

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.750
I'm thinking of quitting my job next year.

00:12:14.833 --> 00:12:16.792
Who are you trying to fool?

00:12:17.542 --> 00:12:19.750
Come on, why are you saying that?

00:12:20.875 --> 00:12:23.458
Someone who wants to leave just leaves.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:27.375
- But you must plan before doing anything.
- No, man!

00:12:27.458 --> 00:12:29.833
Those who plan never see that next year.

00:12:29.917 --> 00:12:32.000
No, you're right. You're right.

00:12:33.042 --> 00:12:35.333
I also somehow want to

00:12:36.208 --> 00:12:39.083
run away from this planned life.

00:12:39.167 --> 00:12:41.708
I'm tired of living by a plan
all the time.

00:12:42.708 --> 00:12:44.542
I also want to forget

00:12:44.625 --> 00:12:46.667
which day is Saturday and which is Sunday,

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:48.625
and when it's a weekend or a weekday.

00:12:49.125 --> 00:12:50.333
You know?

00:12:52.064 --> 00:12:53.333
There's a solution to everything.

00:12:53.417 --> 00:12:55.417
- What?
- Musafir Cafe.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:57.042
- Hey.
- Hey.

00:12:57.125 --> 00:12:58.083
Hey.

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:05.917
You know, Chander, you're only
completely honest when you’re drunk.

00:13:06.625 --> 00:13:07.583
Really?

00:13:11.625 --> 00:13:15.292
Maybe you just don't allow yourself
to be honest when you're sober.

00:13:16.375 --> 00:13:21.125
To simply sit back and have
an open conversation about your cafe.

00:13:25.333 --> 00:13:26.417
Talk about it.

00:13:27.625 --> 00:13:28.583
I'm listening.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.917
You know, in my cafe…

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:43.542
<i>there will be a lot of books.</i>

00:13:44.208 --> 00:13:47.083
<i>People will come and read those books.</i>

00:13:47.833 --> 00:13:52.167
<i>Rather than asking for the Wi-Fi password,</i>
<i>they will just keep talking to each other.</i>

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:56.750
<i>In the midst of their fast-paced lives,</i>
<i>they will sit and think calmly.</i>

00:13:57.958 --> 00:13:59.833
<i>They will share their mistakes,</i>

00:13:59.917 --> 00:14:03.250
<i>their dreams,</i>
<i>and their fears with each other.</i>

00:14:06.417 --> 00:14:07.292
Tell me more.

00:14:09.167 --> 00:14:11.667
And, sometimes, I picture

00:14:12.292 --> 00:14:13.875
having a beautiful daughter…

00:14:15.625 --> 00:14:18.458
who chatters away just like you
and talks a lot.

00:14:18.542 --> 00:14:21.000
Who I can talk to,

00:14:21.083 --> 00:14:22.875
up in the mountains, far from the city.

00:14:22.958 --> 00:14:26.417
Gathering all the kids in the mountains,
I would tell them stories.

00:14:27.708 --> 00:14:29.292
This is my truth, you know?

00:14:30.167 --> 00:14:31.792
But, Sudha,

00:14:31.875 --> 00:14:34.792
sometimes I get scared of my own dreams.

00:14:35.917 --> 00:14:38.125
So much that I hesitate
to talk about them.

00:14:38.875 --> 00:14:42.750
Because I've never opened my heart
to anyone like this.

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:47.125
- I don't know how it'll all happen.
- It will.

00:14:47.833 --> 00:14:48.917
It definitely will.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:52.208
But for now,

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:55.167
please tell me more

00:14:55.917 --> 00:14:58.042
about this Chander in the mountains.

00:15:01.708 --> 00:15:06.375
While an old man walks down the street,

00:15:06.458 --> 00:15:08.000
<i>I want to stop him and ask</i>

00:15:08.083 --> 00:15:10.417
<i>who he's waiting for</i>
<i>with those broken glasses.</i>

00:15:11.792 --> 00:15:15.875
<i>I want to meet those women</i>
<i>who carried that burden on their heads</i>

00:15:15.958 --> 00:15:19.417
<i>so their daughters could</i>
<i>ride a bicycle to school.</i>

00:15:20.917 --> 00:15:23.750
<i>At a tea stall far away from the city,</i>

00:15:23.833 --> 00:15:26.125
<i>I'd like to sit and hear</i>
<i>someone's stories.</i>

00:15:27.583 --> 00:15:31.917
<i>I'd like to sit peacefully</i>
<i>and watch the sunset.</i>

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:35.542
<i>I want to lose myself</i>
<i>in those high mountains.</i>

00:15:47.083 --> 00:15:49.125
Today, I finally got to meet your dreams.

00:15:49.208 --> 00:15:51.042
Which are very different from yours.

00:15:51.125 --> 00:15:52.708
They are different.

00:15:54.125 --> 00:15:56.250
But hearing them made me happy.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:00.958
And those mountains, a beautiful cafe…

00:16:02.208 --> 00:16:04.375
This is your purpose, Chander.

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:09.917
Do you realize how happy I feel

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:12.042
meeting this Chander?

00:16:13.917 --> 00:16:14.917
Me too.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:20.833
Musafir Cafe.

00:16:23.667 --> 00:16:25.833
That's what I will name it.

00:16:32.458 --> 00:16:33.917
I can't show this to you.

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.458
- Why?
- Oh, no. I can't.

00:16:35.542 --> 00:16:36.583
I can't.

00:16:38.167 --> 00:16:41.500
- What do you mean--
- Alright, fine, I'll show you.

00:16:43.292 --> 00:16:44.833
We may not have made it to the Andamans,

00:16:44.917 --> 00:16:47.583
but we can still
head to the mountains together.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:51.458
- We can do some cafe research too.
- Chander!

00:16:55.792 --> 00:16:59.750
This one here is called
Mark & Nilima's Homestay.

00:16:59.833 --> 00:17:01.375
<i>Looks good, right?</i>

00:17:21.917 --> 00:17:27.417
<i>Having you by my side is all I need</i>

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:33.875
<i>My heart finding its way to yours</i>
<i>Is enough for me</i>

00:17:33.958 --> 00:17:35.792
- Hello!
- Hello!

00:17:35.875 --> 00:17:36.750
Hi.

00:17:39.458 --> 00:17:41.542
- Mr. and Mrs. Sharma?
- Yes.

00:17:42.083 --> 00:17:44.083
Hi. Good morning.

00:17:44.167 --> 00:17:45.542
- Hi. Good morning.
- Hello.

00:17:47.167 --> 00:17:48.167
Okay.

00:17:50.458 --> 00:17:53.000
So, is it your first time in Mussoorie?

00:17:53.083 --> 00:17:54.198
- Yes.
- Yes.

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:56.273
Good, good, good.
It's a beautiful place.

00:17:57.208 --> 00:17:58.750
You both have such a beautiful lodge!

00:17:58.833 --> 00:18:00.375
This is our home.

00:18:01.083 --> 00:18:02.208
- Oh!
- Yes.

00:18:02.292 --> 00:18:05.833
You won't get all the conveniences
of a hotel here,

00:18:05.917 --> 00:18:09.167
but you will get lots of stories,

00:18:09.708 --> 00:18:13.333
Nilima's vinyls,
and my special homemade jams.

00:18:13.417 --> 00:18:16.083
You both will definitely love them.

00:18:16.167 --> 00:18:18.750
By the way, don't take Mark's words
too seriously.

00:18:19.292 --> 00:18:21.500
He exaggerates a little.

00:18:21.583 --> 00:18:24.167
There you go.
Okay, let's take you to your rooms. Come.

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:26.208
- Come.
- I'll take that. I'll take that.

00:18:26.292 --> 00:18:28.167
Alright, you take that.
I'll take this one.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.333
How long have you been in Mussoorie?

00:18:31.292 --> 00:18:33.125
It's been about ten years.

00:18:36.375 --> 00:18:38.250
When did you two get married?

00:18:38.333 --> 00:18:39.583
- Last week.
- Last month.

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:41.708
Sorry?

00:18:41.792 --> 00:18:43.500
- Last week.
- Last month.

00:18:47.583 --> 00:18:49.708
Come, come, come.

00:18:57.625 --> 00:18:59.333
What a beautiful room!

00:18:59.417 --> 00:19:00.708
- Yeah.
- Right?

00:19:01.333 --> 00:19:02.500
Thank you.

00:19:03.083 --> 00:19:05.917
It took Nilima and me ten years
to build this house.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.292
You two are so wonderful.

00:19:09.042 --> 00:19:12.167
Well, I don't know about myself, but…

00:19:12.958 --> 00:19:15.375
Nilima is the most wonderful.

00:19:15.458 --> 00:19:16.375
Oh, really?

00:19:17.417 --> 00:19:19.208
By the way, how long
have you been married?

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:23.750
Why do you need to get married
just to live together?

00:19:27.625 --> 00:19:30.375
It's late.
So, you two, get some rest.

00:19:30.458 --> 00:19:33.000
- And we'll talk more.
- Yeah.

00:19:33.083 --> 00:19:34.917
Okay? Happy honeymoon!

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.542
- Thank you.
- Enjoy your stay here.

00:19:36.625 --> 00:19:37.833
- Good night.
- Good night.

00:19:47.625 --> 00:19:49.333
Had we not come here that day,

00:19:51.125 --> 00:19:53.542
Musafir Cafe would have
remained a dream, right?

00:19:55.833 --> 00:19:56.833
Yep.

00:19:59.542 --> 00:20:01.625
But you fulfilled your dream.

00:20:02.625 --> 00:20:04.625
You and Preeti together.

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:09.500
Remember what Nilima used to say?

00:20:11.292 --> 00:20:14.250
"People come into our lives
for various reasons,

00:20:15.667 --> 00:20:17.583
but the ones who stay

00:20:18.833 --> 00:20:21.833
bring the most beautiful companionship."

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:37.333
<i>Remain in my gaze forever</i>

00:20:37.417 --> 00:20:42.917
<i>Speak all that blooms within your heart</i>

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:48.292
<i>Let every breath you take reach me</i>

00:20:48.375 --> 00:20:54.250
<i>Let your love remain mine alone</i>

00:20:54.333 --> 00:20:59.958
<i>You're what my eyes are used to seeing</i>

00:21:00.042 --> 00:21:05.917
<i>And though you belong to me</i>
<i>I still yearn for you</i>

00:21:08.042 --> 00:21:14.208
<i>Having you by my side is all I need</i>

00:21:14.292 --> 00:21:21.208
<i>My heart finding its way to yours</i>
<i>Is enough for me</i>

00:21:21.292 --> 00:21:23.667
<i>That's enough for me</i>

00:21:25.333 --> 00:21:31.125
<i>Having you by my side is all I need</i>

00:21:31.208 --> 00:21:38.042
<i>My heart finding its way to yours</i>
<i>Is enough for me</i>

00:21:40.792 --> 00:21:44.750
<i>That's enough for me</i>

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:09.333
<i>Is that enough for you?</i>

00:22:09.417 --> 00:22:15.333
<i>Why not tell me what your heart holds?</i>

00:24:42.125 --> 00:24:44.125
